          "points": 0.2,
          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Suppose a singly linked list of integers is given below and p is a reference to the node with value 3 in the list (i.e. p.info=3):<br/>(head) 7 11 6 14 3 9 8 12 (tail)<br/>What does the list look like after the following java code snippet is run?</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">x</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-type\">Node</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">f</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> head;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">while</span>(f.next != p) f = f.next;\n<span class=\"hljs-type\">Node</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">q</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Node</span>(x);\nq.next = p;\nf.next = q;</code></pre></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Giả sử cho một danh sách liên kết đơn các số nguyên như bên dưới và p là tham chiếu tới node có giá trị 3 trong danh sách (tức p.info=3):<br/>(head) 7 11 6 14 3 9 8 12 (tail)<br/>Danh sách sẽ trông như thế nào sau khi đoạn mã Java sau được chạy?</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">x</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-type\">Node</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">f</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> head;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">while</span>(f.next != p) f = f.next;\n<span class=\"hljs-type\">Node</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">q</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Node</span>(x);\nq.next = p;\nf.next = q;</code></pre></div>",
