          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>From the tree: root-&gt;1 = A; root-&gt;0-&gt;1 = C; root-&gt;0-&gt;0 = B. So codes are A=1, B=00, C=01. Decode 0111000000101 bit by bit, restarting at the root after each leaf: &quot;01&quot;-&gt;C, &quot;1&quot;-&gt;A, &quot;1&quot;-&gt;A, &quot;00&quot;-&gt;B, &quot;00&quot;-&gt;B, &quot;00&quot;-&gt;B, &quot;1&quot;-&gt;A, &quot;01&quot;-&gt;C. Decoded sequence: C,A,A,B,B,B,A,C = CAABBBAC. Answer: A.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Từ cây: root-&gt;1 = A; root-&gt;0-&gt;1 = C; root-&gt;0-&gt;0 = B. Vậy mã là A=1, B=00, C=01. Giải mã 0111000000101 từng bit, quay lại gốc sau mỗi lần chạm lá: &quot;01&quot;-&gt;C, &quot;1&quot;-&gt;A, &quot;1&quot;-&gt;A, &quot;00&quot;-&gt;B, &quot;00&quot;-&gt;B, &quot;00&quot;-&gt;B, &quot;1&quot;-&gt;A, &quot;01&quot;-&gt;C. Chuỗi giải mã: C,A,A,B,B,B,A,C = CAABBBAC. Đáp án: A.</p></div>"
